    "description": "Help topic title: security, app lock and encryption."
  },
  "helpPrivacyIntro": "SreerajP ToDo is built from the ground up with a privacy-first, zero-trust offline architecture. Your personal productivity data is strongly encrypted and protected by multiple layers of security.",
